て使ってみたことはありますが、あまり違いがなかった気がします。\nちなみに、iterm2は透明にすると GPU acceleration が効かなくなるという話は聞きました。","ts":"1633602037.337100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XrRa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92a545f3-837b-45ce-b977-0b34f053d27f","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"そうなんですか？\nAlacritty の透過は \u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/issues/3609\u003e\nこのissue に書いてあるように、background image の代替として取り入れられた機能みたいですね。\n上のissueで頑なにbackground image を断る開発者.......","ts":"1633601877.334900","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/issues/3609|#3609 Feature Request: Set background to image\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/issues/3609|#3609 Feature Request: Set background to image\u003e","text":"Hi, I would like to use something like \u003chttps://github.com/LazoCoder/Pokemon-Terminal|Pokemon-Terminal\u003e with Alacritty.\n\nIs there any way to set the background of Alacritty to an image, not merely a color? And if so, is there some way that it can be done programatically, dynamically? What kind of work is required to make this happen? Is it within the scope of Alacritty to add this feature?\n\nThanks!","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"F - duplicate","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty|alacritty/alacritty\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1587244568}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HTm7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D10E30EA-5B06-4BCA-BCA2-0729653C6145","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Alacritty透過試してるんですけど、これってGPUレンダリング効かなくなるんでしたっけ","ts":"1633601715.332900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XwJpk"}]},{"client_